<title>USA: Nasdaq says MCI asks for continued halt.</title>
<headline>Nasdaq says MCI asks for continued halt.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON, D.C. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Nasdaq Stock Market said Friday that MCI Communications Corp has requested a continuation of the halt of trading in its stock.</p>
<p>This request continues a trading halt that began Friday afternoon at 1327 EST.</p>
<p>Nasdaq said the halt will continue until additional news is announced. Nasdaq said it expects the news to come out prior to the opening of the market Monday morning.</p>
</text>
